        <content type="html" xml:base="https://aw2.help/builds/quickness-power-ritualist/">&lt;h2 id=&quot;introduction&quot;&gt;Introduction&lt;&#x2F;h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quickness Ritualist does not require specialised boon duration gear and works well with other builds that are power-based.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The build provides boons and most importantly quickness just by summoning spirits. The uses of offhand sword allows for systematic upkeep of &lt;span class=&quot;armory-inline&quot; data-armory-embed=&quot;items&quot; data-armory-ids=&quot;103574&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;span&gt; Relic of the Claw.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
